{"type":"lesson","lesson":{"title":"導數：某一瞬間的變化率","subject":"math","crumbs":["數學","微積分"],"steps":[{"text":"這是 f(x) = x²，曲線上有一點 P，位在 x = 1。曲線每個地方陡的程度都不同，我們想問：**就在 P 這一點，它有多陡？**","set":[{"name":"p","value":1},{"name":"h","value":2}]},{"text":"算斜率需要兩個點，所以先在右邊借一個點 Q，兩點相距 h = 2。高度從 1 升到 9，連線（割線）的斜率是 8 ÷ 2 = 4，這是**這一段的平均變化率**。","set":[{"name":"p","value":1},{"name":"h","value":2}]},{"text":"讓 Q 靠近 P，把 h 縮成 1。高度變化是 3，斜率變成 3 ÷ 1 = 3。**區間越短，越能代表 P 附近的陡度**。","set":[{"name":"p","value":1},{"name":"h","value":1}]},{"text":"再把 h 縮到 0.001，斜率是 2.001。割線幾乎貼上藍色強調的切線，**斜率一路逼近 2**。","set":[{"name":"p","value":1},{"name":"h","value":0.001}]},{"text":"所以 **導數就是 h 趨近 0 時，割線斜率逼近的那個值**：f′(p) = lim [f(p+h) − f(p)] ÷ h。這裡化簡後是 2p + h，h 趨近 0 就剩 2p，所以 f′(1) = 2。","set":[{"name":"p","value":1},{"name":"h","value":0.001}]},{"text":"P 移到 x = 2，切線斜率變成 4。把每個位置的斜率記下來，就得到虛線 f′(x) = 2x：**導數告訴你每一點當下變化得多快、往哪個方向變**。例如位置對時間的導數就是瞬時速度。","set":[{"name":"p","value":2},{"name":"h","value":0.001}]}],"task":"先拖動 h 滑桿看割線怎麼變成切線，到最後一步再左右拖動 P，比較切線斜率和虛線上那一點的高度。","suggestions":["為什麼不能直接讓 h 等於 0？","x³ 的導數要怎麼用同樣方法算出來？","導數是 0 的地方代表什麼？"],"widget":{"kind":"plot","plot":{"x":[-2.5,4],"y":[-3.5,10],"params":[{"name":"p","label":"P 的位置 p","min":-1.5,"max":2.5,"value":1,"step":0.01,"slider":true},{"name":"h","label":"間距 h","min":0.001,"max":2,"value":2,"step":0.001,"slider":true}],"items":[{"type":"function","expr":"x^2","color":"ink","label":"f(x) = x²"},{"type":"segment","from":["p","p^2"],"to":["p+h","p^2"],"color":"muted","dashed":true,"show":[1,4]},{"type":"segment","from":["p+h","p^2"],"to":["p+h","(p+h)^2"],"color":"muted","dashed":true,"show":[1,4]},{"type":"function","expr":"p^2 + (2*p+h)*(x-p)","color":"ink","label":"割線","show":[1,2]},{"type":"function","expr":"p^2 + (2*p+h)*(x-p)","color":"muted","show":[3,4]},{"type":"tangent","expr":"x^2","at":"p","color":"accent","label":"切線","show":[3,5]},{"type":"point","x":"p+h","y":"(p+h)^2","color":"ink","label":"Q","show":[1,4]},{"type":"function","expr":"2*x","color":"muted","dashed":true,"label":"f′(x) = 2x","show":[5,5]},{"type":"segment","from":["p",0],"to":["p","2*p"],"color":"muted","dashed":true,"show":[5,5]},{"type":"point","x":"p","y":"2*p","color":"accent","label":"斜率值","show":[5,5]},{"type":"point","x":"p","y":"p^2","drag":"p","color":"accent","label":"P"}],"readouts":[{"label":"間距 h","expr":"h","digits":3},{"label":"高度變化","expr":"(p+h)^2 - p^2","digits":3},{"label":"割線斜率（高度變化 ÷ h）","expr":"((p+h)^2 - p^2)/h","digits":3},{"label":"導數 f′(p) = 2p","expr":"2*p","digits":2}]}}},"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5"}
